OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOrkney
OL,6,Fcloudy with occasional rain on         
OL,7,FWednesday, with Shetland brighter and  
OL,8,Fmore showery. Sunny intervals and      
OL,9,Fshowers on Thursday, then Friday       
OL,10,Fturning cloudier with rain.            
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
